'''A Minecraft Movie: Capes Trailer''' is a trailer for three [[Cape|capes]] promoting {{AMCM}}, filmed on the [[A Minecraft Movie Live Event]].

== Summary ==
Within {{AMCM|Midport Village}}, three heroes each take on a different activity. After a flash of {{AMCM|Steve}}, he enters into a [[A Minecraft Movie Live Event#The Pit|mine]] wearing the [[Yearn Cape|yearn cape]]. After harvesting {{AMCM}} he leaps over a hole in a platform, meanwhile {{AMCM|Dawn}} is wearing the [[home cape]] in a [[A Minecraft Movie Live Event#Lower Drop in Village|neighborhood]]. She buys from a {{AMCM|weaponsmith}}, befriends a {{AMCM|cat}}, and plays {{AMCM|saxophone}} surrounded by {{AMCM|llama}}s. Elsewhere in the region, {{AMCM|Natalie}} has the [[menace cape]] and eats {{AMCM|lava chicken}}, setting herself on fire to run over a bridge faster. She proceeds to fight against a {{AMCM|piglin}} invasion at the town [[A Minecraft Movie Live Event#Outer Walls|wall]], before leaping in to battle them herself using the heat generated from her body. The three converge back at {{AMCM|Steve's Lava Chicken!|Steve's Lava Chicken}} and show off their capes.

